google-sign-in-light.svg and google-sign-in-dark.svg are Google's "Sign in with
Google" buttons for the web, Android + Web/SVG/Light/Theme=Light, Show text=Yes,
Shape=Pill, Platform=Android+Web.svg and its Dark one, from
https://developers.google.com/static/identity/images/signin-assets.zip
(https://developers.google.com/identity/branding-guidelines), used unchanged as
Google's sign-in branding guidelines ask.
